{"seq":1,"slug":"spring-and-autumn-sage","title":"春秋之圣","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-sage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-times-of-laozi","title":"老子的时代","url":"/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-sage/the-times-of-laozi","wordCount":1720,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"keeper-of-the-archives","title":"守藏室之史","url":"/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-sage/keeper-of-the-archives","wordCount":1691,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 春秋之圣\n\n本章讲述老子所处的时代与其早年经历。老子生活的春秋时期，礼崩乐坏、思想激荡，孕育了他深邃的哲学思想；他曾担任周王朝的守藏室之史，博览群书，积累了渊博的学识。两篇文档，分别呈现老子的时代，以及守藏室之史的经历。\n"}